{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Update","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"A","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"A","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP","text":"Component","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Call an update like a function, passing a closure that receives each entity’s component to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change in place, and the entity. The update’s type says which entities it visits and what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"else it reads, by nesting:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Update<A>"},{"type":"text","text":" changes the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"A"},{"type":"text","text":" of every entity holding one."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Update<A>.And<B>"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Update<A>.And<B>.And<C>"},{"type":"text","text":" change two or three components of every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity holding all of them."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".Over<T...>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" also reads the query terms ","type":"text"},{"code":"T","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", components or ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf","type":"reference"},{"text":" groups,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and visits only the entities that match them. The closure receives them as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryRow","type":"reference"},{"text":", as ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/update(_:over:body:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" does.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".Where<F...>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" visits only the entities that pass the filter types "},{"code":"F","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Without","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Changed","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following system bounces everything that has fallen below the ground, changing both its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"position and its velocity:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@System","struct Bounce {","    func run(_ bouncers: Update<Position>.And<Velocity>) {","        bouncers { position, velocity, _ in","            if position.y < 0 {","                position.y = -position.y","                velocity.dy = -velocity.dy","            }","        }","    }","}","","var world = World()","let ball = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: -2), Velocity(dx: 0, dy: -5))","Schedule { Bounce() }.run(on: &world)","print(world[Position.self, of: ball])","\/\/ Prints \"Position(x: 0.0, y: 2.0)\"","print(world[Velocity.self, of: ball])","\/\/ Prints \"Velocity(dx: 0.0, dy: 5.0)\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragr